#, python-format
msgid "Rewrite"
msgstr "Reescribir"

#. module: muk_ai_chatter
#: model:muk_ai.skill,body:muk_ai_chatter.skill_compose_formal
msgid ""
"Rewrite the selected text in a more formal register, as a professional would"
" write to a customer. Keep the content unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Reescribe el texto seleccionado en un registro más formal, como un "
"profesional escribiría a un cliente. Mantén el contenido sin cambios."

#. module: muk_ai_chatter
#: model:muk_ai.skill,body:muk_ai_chatter.skill_compose_friendly
msgid ""
"Rewrite the selected text in a warmer, more personal tone, without becoming "
"casual or padding it with pleasantries."
msgstr ""
"Reescribe el texto seleccionado con un tono más cálido y personal, sin "
"volverte informal ni rellenarlo de cortesías."

#. module: muk_ai_chatter
#: model:muk_ai.skill,body:muk_ai_chatter.skill_compose_shorten
msgid ""
"Rewrite the selected text so it says the same thing in fewer words. Keep "
"every fact and the tone it was written in."
msgstr ""
"Reescribe el texto seleccionado para que diga lo mismo con menos palabras. "
"Conserva cada dato y el tono."

#. module: muk_ai_chatter
#: model:muk_ai.skill,body:muk_ai_chatter.skill_compose_expand
msgid ""
"Rewrite the selected text with more detail, staying on the same subject. Add"
" nothing that is not already implied by it or by the record."
msgstr ""
"Reescribe el texto seleccionado con más detalle, sin cambiar de tema. No "
"añadas nada que no se deduzca ya de él o del registro."

#. module: muk_ai_chatter
#. odoo-javascript
